&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;A piece of the Markdown, the decoding table from the 3.14 page, shows how an HTML table comes out:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Excerpt of &lt;code&gt;json-3.14.md&lt;/code&gt;, lines 245-254:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight markdown"&gt;&lt;code&gt;| JSON | Python |
| --- | --- |
| object | dict |
| array | list |
| string | str |
| number (int) | int |
| number (real) | float |
| true | True |
| false | False |
| null | None |
