&lt;p&gt;And the comparison:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight plaintext"&gt;&lt;code&gt;$ python catalog_snapshot.py diff before.json after.json changes.csv
