&lt;li&gt;Best practices, including conditional requests and polling: &lt;a href="https://docs.github.com/en/rest/using-the-rest-api/best-practices-for-using-the-rest-api" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://docs.github.com/en/rest/using-the-rest-api/best-practices-for-using-the-rest-api&lt;/a&gt;
